reviewer_comment:
I was just noticing the removal of this code, it means that possibly the buffer as a whole is misaligned?
If minalign==8, and we're writing between 1 to 3 32-bit entities (file identifier, root offset, size), those 3 need to be pre-padded to make this alignment happen.
@rw @pyottamus

