@HadarYosef1 I think we can remove the optional `should_run` and `applicability_score`.

1. The reminders will stay there in the git history if we ever need to reference them
2. They might affect the constrained decoding aspect of structured outputs, potentially slowing down or reducing accuracy in completions.

